---
// src/components/sections/RoadmapSection.astro
---

<section class="section-surface roadmap">
    <div class="roadmap__header">
        <p>Evolución / Sistema</p>
        <p>Después de la V1</p>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap__content">
        <div class="roadmap__intro">
            <h2>Primero medir. Después ampliar.</h2>

            <p>
                Cada nueva capa entra cuando la anterior ya funciona de forma
                estable.
            </p>
        </div>

        <ol class="roadmap__list">
            <li>
                <span>01</span>
                <p>Humedad del suelo</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>02</span>
                <p>Conexión Wi-Fi</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>03</span>
                <p>Visualización web</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>04</span>
                <p>Historial de mediciones</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>05</span>
                <p>Varios sectores</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>06</span>
                <p>Alertas</p>
            </li>

            <li>
                <span>07</span>
                <p>Riego automático</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .roadmap {
        background: var(--color-olive-bg);
        color: var(--color-olive);
    }

    .roadmap__header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .roadmap__header p {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .roadmap__content {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(20rem, 1fr);
        align-items: end;
        gap: 4rem;
    }
    
    .roadmap__intro {
        padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .roadmap__intro h2 {
        max-width: 9ch;
        margin: 0;

        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 0.88;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .roadmap__intro > p {
        max-width: 28rem;
        margin: 2rem 0 0;

        font-size: 0.875rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .roadmap__list {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;

        border-top: 1px dashed currentColor;

        list-style: none;
    }

    .roadmap__list li {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
        gap: 1rem;

        padding: 1rem 0;

        border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }

    .roadmap__list span {
        font-size: 0.6875rem;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .roadmap__list p {
        margin: 0;

        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.375rem);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 48rem) {
        .roadmap__content {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            align-content: end;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .roadmap__intro {
            padding-top: 2rem;
        }

        .roadmap__intro h2 {
            max-width: 8ch;
            font-size: clamp(3.75rem, 17vw, 6rem);
        }

        .roadmap__intro > p {
            max-width: 28rem;
        }

        .roadmap__list li {
            grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
